          >See the 90/90 example loaded in the calculator →</a
        >
      </p>

      <p>
        For the rules behind the counting, see{" "}
        <a href="/blog/the-schengen-90-180-rolling-window"
          >how the 90/180 rolling window works</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>

